  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あれ？　灯織……\r\nお疲れ様",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 310,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 1
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2002021020040,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "お疲れ様です\r\nすみません……キッチンをお借りしています",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200202102/2002021020040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それは全然構わないけど\r\n何かの練習か？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002021020050,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "はい、来週の撮影のために\r\nイメージトレーニングをしておきたくて",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200202102/2002021020050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、そういうことか……\r\n俺にも何か手伝えることはあるか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002021020060,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そうですね……\r\nでは、演技の練習に付き合っていただけませんか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200202102/2002021020060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002021020070,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "販促用の動画は軽く台本があるので",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200202102/2002021020070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "わかった、まかせてくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002021020080,
